Paper Bet Fix + ML Persistence Plan

What I found





The paper-bet form posts to /api/paper-bets without a bearer token from [apps/web/app/bets/new/page.tsx](apps/web/app/bets/new/page.tsx), while backend route requires JWT auth (require_user_id) in [services/prediction-engine/app/main.py](services/prediction-engine/app/main.py). This aligns with your live 401 Unauthorized.



Nightly persistence exists in [services/prediction-engine/app/nightly.py](services/prediction-engine/app/nightly.py), but there is no dedicated end-of-week retrain job.



Current storage mix in [services/prediction-engine/app/storage.py](services/prediction-engine/app/storage.py) and [services/prediction-engine/app/database.py](services/prediction-engine/app/database.py) retains history, but production durability depends on DB backend/deployment.

